{"Swap jewels, chase cascades, finish the goals.":"交換珠寶，追逐瀑布，完成目標。","Choose a mode":"選擇模式","Mode select":"模式選擇","Play":"開始遊戲","Learn":"學習","Journey":"旅程","Daily":"每日","Practice":"練習","Challenge":"挑戰","Score chase":"分數追逐","Daily challenge":"每日挑戰","Short hands-on lessons — one rule at a time.":"简短的实践课程——一次一条规则。","40 authored stages with growing mechanics.":"40 個手工設計關卡，機制逐漸增加。","One shared seed per UTC day. Same board for everyone.":"每個 UTC 天一個共享種子。每个人都使用同一个板。","Your difficulty, your seed, undo allowed. Unrated.":"你的困難，你的種子，允許撤消。未評級。","Tight move limits, timers and altered layouts.":"嚴格的移動限制、計時器和改變的佈局。","Chase the board on a validated shareable seed.":"在可分享的經驗證種子上追逐棋盤。","Help":"說明","How to play":"玩法說明","Settings":"設定","Profile":"個人檔案","Profile & privacy":"個人資料與隱私","Achievements":"成就","Achievements unlocked":"成就已解鎖","Leaderboards":"排行榜","Boards":"棋盤","Global":"全球","Friends":"好友","Back":"返回","Close":"關閉","Start":"開始","Skip":"略過","Text board":"文本板","Click a jewel, then an adjacent jewel, to swap. Keyboard: arrows move the cursor, Enter selects.":"點擊一顆寶石，然後點擊相鄰的寶石進行交換。鍵盤：方向鍵移動游標，Enter 選擇。","Guest":"訪客","guest":"訪客","Player":"玩家","Stage {n} of {total} · {stars}★":"{total}·{stars}★的階段{n}★","{name} · mastery {level}":"{name}·掌握{level}","Best {score}":"最佳 {score}","new board in {time}":"新板{time}","cloud: offline":"雲：離線","cloud: saving…":"雲端：正在儲存…","cloud: synced":"雲端：已同步","Cloud save applied.":"雲端存檔已套用。","Resume round?":"恢復回合？","You have an interrupted round:":"您的回合已中斷：","{name} — score {score}, {moves} moves left.":"{name} — 分數 {score}，{moves} 向左移動。","Resume":"繼續","Discard":"捨棄","Round":"回合","Setup — {mode}":"設定 — {mode}","Rules":"規則","Goals":"目標","Expected duration":"預計時間","Players":"玩家","Assists":"輔助","Ranked?":"排名？","Ranked":"排名","Ranked (personal bests)":"排名（个人最好成绩）","Ranked (recorded locally)":"排名（本地記錄）","Casual":"休閒","{w}×{h} · {colors} colors · {moves} moves":"{w}×{h} · {colors} 顏色 · {moves} 移動","unlimited":"無限","{n} ice":"{n}冰","{n} crates":"{n} 板條箱","{time} timed":"{time}定時","~{n} min":"約 {n} 分鐘","undo":"復原","no undo":"無法復原","hints":"提示","no hints":"無提示","timing assist ×1.5":"定時輔助×1.5","Finish every guided step.":"完成每個引導步驟。","done":"完成","best {score}":"最佳 {score}","One shared seed per UTC day; your best is kept. Next board in {time}.":"每個UTC日一個共享種子；你最好的都會被保留。下一块板在{time}。","Seed":"種子","Seed (optional)":"種子（選填）","Seed: {seed}":"種子：{seed}","random":"隨機","Random":"隨機","any word or phrase":"任何單字或片語","Today's seed":"今日種子","Share a seed with a friend to chase the same board. Fixed ruleset: the same seed and moves always give the same score.":"与朋友分享种子以追逐同一块板。固定規則集：相同的種子和動作總是給予相同的分數。","Stage {n}":"第 {n} 關","Stage {n} — {name}":"第 {n} 階段 — {name}","(mastery)":"（精通）","{n} stars":"{n} 顆星","locked":"已鎖定","{done} of {total} stages complete · {stars}★ earned · mastery stages marked ◆":"{done} 的 {total} 階段完成 · {stars}★ 取得 · 掌握階段標記 ◆","Daily — {date}":"每日 — {date}","Practice — {level}":"練習 — {level}","Objective":"目標","Score":"分數","Moves":"步數","Time":"時間","Board":"棋盤","Pause":"暫停","Paused":"已暫停","Hint":"提示","Undo":"復原","Restart round":"重新開始回合","Leave to menu":"離開至主選單","Lesson":"課程","Your move":"輪到你了","Settling…":"解決…","Resumed":"已繼續","Get ready":"準備好了嗎","Ready…":"準備…","Set…":"設定…","Go!":"開始！","Go! {name}":"走吧！ {name}","Undo allowed":"允許復原","No hints":"無提示","Collect {n} {color}":"收集 {n} 個{color}","Break {n} ice":"打破 {n} 個冰塊","Break {n} crates":"打破 {n} 個板條箱","Score {n}":"分數 {n}","{n} to go":"{n} 去","{n} left":"{n}左","Score {n}.":"得分{n}。","Unlimited moves.":"無限移動。","{n} moves left.":"{n}向左移動。","{n} seconds":"{n} 秒","ruby":"紅寶石","amber":"琥珀色","topaz":"黃玉","emerald":"翡翠","sapphire":"藍寶石","amethyst":"紫水晶","opal":"蛋白石","horizontal ray":"水平射線","vertical ray":"垂直射線","bloom":"綻放","prism":"棱鏡","row {r} column {c}: {what}":"行{r}列{c}：{what}","crate, 1 hit left":"板條箱，剩下 1 個命中","crate, {n} hits left":"板條箱，{n} 向左擊中","frozen":"冷凍","frozen deeply":"深度冷凍","empty":"空白","selected":"已選取","unlimited moves":"無限移動","{n} moves left":"剩餘 {n} 步","{n} legal swaps.":"{n} 合法互換。","The round is over.":"回合結束。","That cell is outside the board.":"該格子在棋盤範圍外。","Jewels must be neighbours to swap.":"寶石必須是鄰居才能交換。","There is no jewel there.":"那裡沒有寶石。","Crates cannot be moved — match beside them.":"木箱無法移動 — 在旁邊配對。","That jewel is frozen in ice. Match through it to crack it.":"那顆寶石被凍結在冰中。匹配它來破解它。","That swap makes no line of three.":"這種交換並不構成三行。","That move was not understood.":"這一舉動不被理解。","Already done.":"已完成。","Nothing to undo.":"沒有可復原的動作。","Hold on — the board is settling.":"稍等－董事會正在穩定。","The lesson is guiding a different move.":"教訓是指導不同的行動。","That move is not legal.":"該步移動不合法。","Hint: watch the two highlighted jewels.":"提示：觀看兩顆突出顯示的珠寶。","Hint shown on the board.":"板上顯示提示。","Undone.":"已復原。","Camera: {preset}":"相機：{preset}","default":"預設","low":"低","high":"高","Step {n} of {total}":"步驟 {n} / 共 {total} 步","Lesson step {n} of {total}.":"{total}的課程步驟{n}。","End lesson":"課程結束","Lesson complete!":"課程完成！","Results":"結果","Commission complete!":"委託完成！","Out of moves":"步數用盡","Round resigned":"回合已放棄","Time expired":"時間已到期","Round over":"回合結束","{n} stars.":"{n} 星。","Score breakdown":"分數明細","Component":"元件","Points":"分數","Total":"總計","Matches":"比賽","Cascade bonuses":"瀑布獎勵","Specials":"特價商品","Blockers cleared":"障礙已清除","Goal bonuses":"進球獎金","Unused-move bonus":"未使用的移動獎勵","No points scored":"沒有得分","Mastery":"精通","+{xp} XP · level {level}":"+{xp} 經驗值 · 等級 {level}","level up!":"升級！","{n} XP to next":"{n} XP 到下一個","Unlocked {type}: {name}":"解鎖{type}：{name}","theme":"主題","trail":"小徑","frame":"框架","title":"標題","Daily streak {n} 🔥":"每日連勝 {n} 🔥","New personal best on this board!":"此板上新的個人最佳成績！","Personal best on this board: {score}.":"该板上的个人最佳成绩：{score}。","Next stage":"下一關","Next lesson":"下一課","Play again":"再玩一次","Retry":"重試","Replay":"重新開始","Replay unavailable for this round.":"本輪無法重播。","Replay of your round — {n} moves.":"重播您的回合 — {n} 動作。","Replay complete — final score {score}.":"重播完成－最終得分{score}。","End replay":"結束重播","Audio":"音訊","Muted":"已靜音","Sound on":"開啟音效","Captions for audio cues":"音效提示字幕","Display & accessibility":"顯示與協助工具","Color palette":"色盤","Default":"預設","Deuteranopia-safe":"綠色弱視安全","Protanopia-safe":"紅色色盲友善","Tritanopia-safe":"藍色弱視安全","High contrast":"高對比","Left-handed layout":"左手配置","Hold to drag jewels":"按住拖曳珠寶","Timing assistance":"時機輔助","Camera":"攝影機","Low (near tabletop)":"低（靠近桌面）","High (top-down)":"高（由上而下）","Controls":"控制","Actions":"動作","Camera preset":"相機預設","Display name":"顯示名稱","Replay tutorials (reset progress)":"重播教學（重置進度）","Tutorials reset — they will play again from Learn.":"教程重置 - 它們將從學習中再次播放。","Danger zone":"危險區域","Reset all data":"重置所有數據","Reset all data?":"重置所有数据？","Erase every local setting, progress record and snapshot for this game.":"刪除該遊戲的所有本機設定、進度記錄和快照。","This erases every local setting, progress record, and snapshot for Jewel Cascade on this device. This cannot be undone.":"這將擦除該裝置上的 Jewel Cascade 的每個本機設定、進度記錄和快照。此操作無法撤銷。","Erase everything":"清除所有資料","Cancel":"取消","Cosmetics":"外觀","Cosmetics change looks only — never rules, timing, or information.":"外觀僅改變外觀 — 絕不改變規則、時機或資訊。","Theme":"主題","Trail":"小徑","Frame":"框架","Title":"標題","(locked)":"（已鎖定）","Career":"生涯","Rounds completed":"已完成回合","Rounds won":"已贏回合","Current win streak":"當前連勝","Best win streak":"最佳連勝紀錄","Total score":"總分","Daily streak":"每日連勝","Level {level} · {xp} XP":"等級 {level} · {xp} XP","{n} to next":"{n} 到下一個","max level":"最高等級","{n} of {total} unlocked.":"{total} 的 {n} 已解鎖。","Unlocked {date}.":"解鎖{date}。","Loading boards…":"正在載入棋盤…","No entries yet — be the first.":"尚無記錄 — 成為第一個吧。","Personal bests on this device:":"此設備上的個人最佳成績：","Boards unavailable right now. Personal bests:":"棋盤目前不可用。個人最佳成績：","When":"時間","No local results yet.":"尚未有本地結果。","Local bests (casual)":"局部最佳（休閒）","Ember Dusk":"餘燼黃昏","Moonlit Forge":"月光熔爐","Verdant Atelier":"翠綠工作室","Frostbound Loft":"霜凍閣樓","Royal Velvet":"皇家天鵝絨","None":"無","Sparks":"火花","Comet embers":"彗星餘燼","Standard":"標準","Brass":"黃銅","Filigree":"花絲","Apprentice":"學徒","Cascade Master":"瀑布大師","Swap & match":"交換&匹配","Swap two neighbouring jewels (drag, or tap one then the other). A swap only counts when it lines up three or more of a color. Keyboard: {keys} move the cursor, {confirm} selects.":"交換兩個相鄰的寶石（拖曳或點擊其中一個，然後點擊另一個）。只有當將三種或更多顏色排成一行時，交換才算數。鍵盤：{keys} 移動遊標，{confirm} 選擇。","Moves & goals":"動作與目標","Every accepted swap spends one move. Finish all goals before moves run out. Goals sit in the objective rail; the HUD shows moves and score.":"每個接受的交換都會花費一步。在步数用完之前完成所有目标。目标位于目标轨道上； HUD 显示动作和得分。","Rays (4 in a line)":"射线（4条线）","A line of four forges a ray. It fires when matched or struck and clears a whole row or column.":"一條四連形成一道射線。它在被配對或擊中時發射，並清除整行或整列。","Blooms (L or T)":"綻放（L 或 T）","Matching around a corner grows a bloom, which clears a 3×3 patch when it fires.":"匹配角落周围会长出一朵花，当它开火时会清除一个 3×3 的区域。","Prisms (5 in a line)":"棱鏡（5個排成一行）","Five in a line cut a prism. Swap it with a jewel to shatter every jewel of that color; swap it with another special for a bigger effect.":"五個排成一列切割棱鏡。將其與寶石交換，以粉碎該顏色的所有寶石；與其他特殊產品交換以獲得更大的效果。","Ice":"冰","Frozen jewels cannot move but still match. Matching through ice cracks it; deep ice takes two hits.":"凍結的珠寶無法移動但仍匹配。穿過冰塊匹配將其破解；深冰會受到兩次打擊。","Crates":"板條箱","Crates hold no jewel and never move. Matches next to a crate dent it; banded crates take two hits.":"木箱不含寶石且永遠不會移動。在木箱旁配對會使其凹陷；帶有帶子的木箱需要兩次攻擊。","Stars & mastery":"星星與掌握","Finish goals for ★, beat score thresholds for ★★ and ★★★. Every round earns mastery XP toward cosmetic themes, trails, frames, and titles — looks only, never power.":"完成目標為★，超過分數閾值為★★和★★★。每一輪都會獲得對外觀主題、軌跡、框架和標題的精通 XP——只有外觀，而不是力量。","Fair play":"公平競賽","Scoring is deterministic: the same seed and the same moves always produce the same score. Daily seeds never change once published.":"評分是確定性的：相同的種子和相同的動作總是產生相同的分數。每日种子一旦发布就不会改变。","[low buzz]":"[低嗡嗡聲]","[chime]":"[鈴聲]","[chime rising x{n}]":"[鐘聲升起x{n}]","[sparkle]":"[閃閃發光]","[big blast]":"[大爆炸]","[blast]":"[爆炸]","[ice crack]":"[冰裂]","[crate breaks]":"[板條箱破損]","[swirl]":"[漩渦]","[warm bell]":"【暖鈴】","[win fanfare]":"[贏得大張旗鼓]","[soft descending tone]":"[柔和的降調]","[time warning]":"[時間警告]","Lesson 1 — First Swaps":"第 1 課 — 第一次交換","Swap two neighbouring jewels to line up three of a kind.":"交換兩顆相鄰的寶石以排列三顆相同的寶石。","This is your workbench. Jewels line up when three or more of a color touch in a row or column. Swap the marked ruby down into the gap — drag it, or tap one jewel and then its neighbour.":"這是您的工作台。當三種或更多顏色在行或列中接觸時，珠寶就會排列起來。將標記的紅寶石向下交換到間隙中 - 拖曳它，或點擊一顆寶石，然後點擊它的鄰居。","A match of three! Matched jewels leave the board and new ones cascade in from above. Now make any legal swap of your own.":"三個一組的配對！配對的寶石會離開棋盤，新的寶石會從上方瀑布般落下。現在進行任何合法的交換。","Well done. A swap only counts when it makes a line — a swap that matches nothing is refused and the jewels slide back.":"幹得好。交換只有在排成一條線時才算數——沒有任何匹配的交換會被拒絕，珠寶會滑回來。","Lesson 2 — Rays (lines of 4)":"第 2 課 — 射線（4 行）","Match four in a line to forge a ray.":"将四个连成一条线来锻造一条射线。","Four in a line forge a RAY. Swap the marked topaz down to complete a line of four.":"四個人排成一列鍛造出一條射線。將標示的黃玉向下交換，形成四顆一線。","You forged a ray! A ray fires when it is matched or struck, clearing its whole row or column. Rays carry a color and match like ordinary jewels. Make any swap to continue.":"你鍛造了一條射線！射線在匹配或撞擊時會發射，清除其整行或整列。光線與普通珠寶一樣具有顏色和搭配。進行任何交換以繼續。","Lesson 3 — Blooms (corners)":"第 3 課 — Bloom（角）","Match an L or T shape to grow a bloom.":"搭配L或T形狀來種植花。","Matching around a corner — an L or a T — grows a BLOOM. Swap the marked sapphire left into the corner.":"在轉角處配對 — L 或 T — 會生長出 BLOOM。將左側標記的藍寶石交換到角落。","A bloom! When it fires it clears a 3×3 patch around itself. Make any swap to continue.":"開花了！綻放時會清除周圍 3×3 的區域。進行任何交換以繼續。","Lesson 4 — Prisms (lines of 5)":"第 4 課 — 稜鏡（5 行）","Match five in a line to cut a prism.":"將五個連成一線以切割稜鏡。","Five in a line cut a PRISM — the rarest jewel on the bench. Swap the marked emerald down to complete five.":"五人排成一列切割稜鏡－長椅上最稀有的寶石。將標記的祖母綠向下交換以完成五個。","A prism! Swap a prism with any neighbour to shatter every jewel of that color — or with another special for something spectacular. Make any swap to continue.":"一個棱鏡！將棱鏡與任何相鄰的寶石交換，以粉碎該顏色的每顆寶石——或者與另一個特殊寶石交換以獲得壯觀效果。進行任何交換以繼續。","Lesson 5 — Ice":"第 5 課 — 冰","Frozen jewels cannot move. Match through them to crack the ice.":"凍結的珠寶無法移動。透過它們來消除冰塊。","Jewels under ice are frozen — they cannot be swapped, but they still match. Swap the marked sapphire down so the line runs THROUGH the frozen jewel, cracking its ice.":"冰下的珠寶被凍結——它們無法交換，但它們仍然匹配。將標記的藍寶石向下交換，使線穿過凍結的寶石，使冰破裂。","Cracked! The ice broke and the jewel was collected. One more frozen jewel remains on the bench — play on and break it, or just finish the round.":"碎裂！冰層破裂，寶石已被收集。長凳上還剩一顆冰凍寶石 — 繼續打破它，或直接完成回合。","Lesson 6 — Crates":"第 6 課 — 板條箱","Crates block cells. Matches beside them break them.":"木箱阻擋格子。在旁邊配對可打破它們。","Crates pin the board: they hold no jewel and never move. A match made NEXT to a crate dents it. Swap the marked emerald down — the line will smash both crates at once.":"木箱固定了棋盤：它們不含寶石且永遠不會移動。在木箱旁配對會使其凹陷。將標記的祖母綠向下交換 — 該列將同時擊碎兩個木箱。","Both crates broke from one match! Tough crates take two hits. Make any swap to finish the lesson.":"兩個板條箱被一次匹配打破！堅固的板條箱需要兩次擊中。進行任何交換即可完成教學。","First Light":"第一縷曙光","Gather rubies and amber for the workshop lamps.":"收集紅寶石和琥珀用於車間燈。","Kindling":"點火","Amber and topaz for the kiln.":"琥珀和黃玉用於窯爐。","Sixth Shelf":"第六架","A sixth color joins the bench.":"第六種顏色加入候補席。","Triple Order":"三重訂單","Three commissions at once.":"一次三項佣金。","Apprentice Trial":"學徒試煉","Mastery: prove the basics under a tighter move limit.":"精通：在更严格的移动限制下证明基础知识。","First Frost":"初霜","A cold snap froze six jewels. Match through them to crack the ice.":"寒流凍住了六顆寶石。透過它們進行配對以擊碎冰層。","Thin Ice":"薄冰","More frost, same patience.":"更多的霜，同样的耐心。","Deep Freeze":"深度冷凍","Double ice takes two hits each.":"雙冰各受到兩次打擊。","Frozen Cargo":"冷凍貨物","Free the amethyst shipment.":"釋放紫水晶貨物。","Glacier Trial":"冰河審判","Mastery: heavy frost, full commission.":"精通：重霜，滿佣金。","Packing Day":"包裝日","Crates block cells. Match beside them to break them.":"木箱阻擋格子。在旁邊配對以打破它們。","Heavy Stock":"重庫存","More crates in the way.":"路上有更多板條箱。","Reinforced":"強化","Sturdy crates take two hits.":"坚固的板条箱可承受两次撞击。","Warehouse Maze":"倉庫迷宮","Crates in a cut-corner hall.":"切角大廳中的木箱。","Storekeeper Trial":"店主審判","Mastery: frost and freight together.":"精通：冰霜和貨運在一起。","Broken Bench":"破損長椅","Holes in the bench change how jewels fall.":"工作台上的孔改變了珠寶掉落的方式。","The Hollow":"空心","A hole in the middle of everything.":"萬物中心的一個洞。","Cold Columns":"寒冷列柱","Split columns, frozen stock.":"分流柱，冷冻原料。","Quota":"配額","The guild wants points, not pretty colors. Cascades and specials pay best.":"公會想要積分，而不是漂亮的顏色。級聯和特價產品性價比最高。","Comptroller Trial":"審計長試煉","Mastery: a high quota on a broken board.":"精通：破損板上的高配額。","Grand Bench":"大長凳","A wider workbench.":"更寬的工作台。","Seventh Color":"第七色","Opal joins the spectrum.":"蛋白石加入了光譜。","Opal Rush":"蛋白石熱潮","Opals scatter the eye.":"蛋白石分散眼睛。","Frosted Gallery":"磨砂畫廊","A cold gallery of seven colors.":"七種色彩的冰冷展廊。","Curator Trial":"策展人試煉","Mastery: quota and frost on the grand bench.":"精通：大板凳上的配额和霜冻。","Deep Cold":"深冷","The deep cold returns.":"嚴寒再次降臨。","Ironbound":"鐵界","Reinforced crates around the hollow.":"空心周圍的加固板條箱。","Salt Cellar":"鹽窖","Crates and frost in the cellar.":"地窖裡的木箱與霜凍。","Night Audit":"夜間審核","Points and amethyst before dawn.":"黎明前的積分與紫水晶。","Warden Trial":"典獄長審判","Mastery: every blocker you know.":"精通：你所知道的每一個攔截器。","Twin Furnaces":"雙爐","Two great orders, one bench.":"兩個大訂單，一張板凳。","Frozen Vault":"冰凍金庫","A vault of seven-color frost.":"七色霜之寶庫。","Crate District":"木箱區","A district of freight.":"一個貨運區。","High Quota":"高配額","The guild raises its sights.":"公會抬起了目光。","Assayer Trial":"試金者試煉","Mastery: quota among reinforced stock.":"精通：強化庫存中的配額。","Ember Wind":"灰燼之風","A narrow waist concentrates the fall.":"一個狹窄的腰部集中了下落。","Moon Quota":"月球配額","Tight moves over cut corners.":"採取緊縮動作，避免偷工減料。","Frozen Freight":"冷凍貨運","The hardest storage room in the workshop.":"車間內最堅硬的儲藏室。","Penultimate Order":"倒數第二個訂單","Three colors, seven hues, no excuses.":"三種顏色，七種色調，沒有任何藉口。","Master of the Cascade":"級聯大師","Final mastery: everything the workshop has taught you.":"最終掌握：研討會教給您的一切。","One shared board for every player today. Same seed, same rules.":"今天每個玩家都有一個共享板。相同的種子，相同的規則。","Easy":"簡單","Five colors, generous moves. Learn the rhythms.":"五種顏色，動作大方。學習節奏。","Medium":"中等","Six colors and a few crates.":"六種顏色和一些板條箱。","Hard":"困難","Frost on a split-column board.":"分柱板上的霜。","Expert":"專家","Seven colors, a quota, and no room for waste.":"七种颜色，一个配额，没有浪费的余地。","Sprint":"衝刺","Ninety seconds. Unlimited swaps — how much can you score?":"九十秒。無限交換－你能得分多少？","Eight Moves":"八步","Twelve emeralds in only eight swaps.":"光是八次交換就有十二顆祖母綠。","Ice Storm":"冰風暴","Crack sixteen sheets of ice before the moves run out.":"在步數用盡前打破十六片冰層。","Crate Maze":"木箱迷宮","A maze of freight. Clear every crate.":"一個貨運迷宮。清除每個板條箱。","Hourglass":"沙漏","A tight-waisted board and a quota.":"緊腰棋盤和配額。","Seven Seas":"七大洋","All seven colors, few moves, big order.":"七種顏色，步數有限，訂單很大。","Master's Eye":"大師之眼","No hints. Trust your reading of the board.":"沒有提示。相信您對黑板的閱讀。","Grand Trial":"大審判","Frost, freight, and a quota on the grand bench.":"霜凍、運費和大板凳上的配額。","Fixed ruleset, player-chosen seed. Reach {target} points in {moves} moves; every unused move banks +{bonus}.":"固定規則集，玩家選擇的種子。在 {moves} 步數中達到 {target} 點；每個未使用的行動銀行+{bonus}。","First Setting":"第一設置","Complete your first stage, any mode.":"完成你的第一個關卡，任何模式。","Full Spectrum Lapidary":"全光譜寶石","Create a ray, a bloom, and a prism over your career.":"在你的職業生涯中創造一道射線、一朵花和一個稜鏡。","Steady Hands":"穩定雙手","Win five rounds in a row, any mode.":"在任何模式下連續贏得五輪。","Complete the final Journey stage.":"完成最終旅程關卡。","Hundred Evenings":"百夜","Complete one hundred rounds in total.":"總共完成一百回合。","{hint} hint · {undo} undo (practice) · {skip} skip animation · {camera} camera · {mute} mute · {pause} pause. Gamepad: {a} select, {b} cancel, {x} hint, {y} undo, {start} pause. Rebind everything in the StarHermit Options.":"{hint}提示·{undo}撤銷（練習）·{skip}跳過動畫·{camera}相機·{mute}靜音·{pause}暫停。手把：{a}選擇、{b}取消、{x}提示、{y}撤銷、{start}暫停。重新綁定 StarHermit 選項中的所有內容。","row {r} column {c}":"第 {r} 行第 {c} 列","Volumes for music, effects and the interface, the voice limit and mute are in the StarHermit Options.":"音樂、效果和介面的音量、聲音限制和靜音都在StarHermit選項中。","Text size, high contrast, reduced motion and vibration are in the StarHermit Options.":"文字大小、高對比、減少的運動和振動都在 StarHermit 選項中。","Graphics quality, render scale and the frame-rate limit are in the StarHermit Options.":"圖形品質、渲染比例和幀速率限制在StarHermit選項。","Keys and gamepad buttons are rebound in the StarHermit Options.":"按鍵和手把按鈕在 StarHermit 選項中重新綁定。","Progress reset.":"進度已重置。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Mute game sounds":"靜音遊戲聲音","High score":"最高分","Graphics":"圖形","Change keys and buttons":"變更按鍵與按鈕"}
